#'Gift IDs and Names':/ee core/gifts.json
#'The ; chains both commands':/irst the /give, then the >> overlay.
follow:/give @a minecraft:golden_apple 7 ; >>New Follower!|{user} is now following you!|5
#'Use with caution':/void expensive or spammy commands here.
#join:>>Welcome!|{user} just joined the stream!
#'Use with caution':/void expensive or spammy commands here.
#comment:>>{user} wrote:|{comment}
#'"likes" fires every N likes (default':/very 100, configured in config.yaml).
likes:/execute at @a run summon minecraft:creeper ~ ~ ~ x2
#'"like_2" fires at a bigger milestone (default':/very 100_000 likes).
#'The ; chains both commands':/clear runs first, then /kill.
like_2:/clear @a * ; /kill @a
#'--- Rose (Gift ID':/655) ---
#Parameters:!tnt <Amount> <Delay> <Fuse> <Player>
5655:!tnt 2 0.1 2 Notch
#'--- Mamma Mia (Gift ID':/6111) ---
16111:/give @a minecraft:diamond
#'--- Rosa (Gift ID':/913) ---
8913:/execute at @a run summon minecraft:evoker ~ ~ ~ x3
#'--- Corgi (Gift ID':/267) ---
#'Same syntax as above':!tnt <Amount> <Delay> <Fuse> <Player>
6267:!tnt 600 0.1 2 Notch
#'--- Money Gun (Gift ID':/168) ---
7168:/execute at @a run summon minecraft:wither ~ ~ ~ x50
#'--- Flower Show (Gift ID':/6071) ---
#'random_triggers > triggers (default':/ikes, like_2, follow, join, comment)
16071:$random
'Tom the Tomato':$random
16379:$random
